OL,3,GNEWSAParents fight to save nursery sold
OL,4,Ato Premier League club
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of parents have signed a
OL,7,Fpetition in an attempt to save a
OL,8,Fsouth-east London nursery from closure
OL,9,Fin December after it was sold to a
OL,10,FPremier League club.
OL,12,FThe site at New Beckenham - owned by
OL,13,FHSBC and home to local sports clubs
OL,14,Fincluding a cricket club - has been
OL,15,Fpurchased by Crystal Palace Football
OL,16,FClub, whose academy complex already
OL,17,Fborders the area.
OL,19,FParents were informed of the sale
OL,20,Fthrough a letter from Bright Horizons
OL,21,Fearlier this month.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
